    "created_at": "2016-05-11T10:05:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-11T10:05:12Z",
    "body": "We could move the \"implements\" statements to the \"interfaces\" and add a note below the mixins. I think that is reasonable. HTML has similar faults and there's not really an organized way we go about this.\n\nA mixin is a term IDL will eventually adopt to describe these [NoInterfaceObject] interfaces shared by several \"interfaces\" (really objects or classes, another thing IDL should eventually change).\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
