    "updated_at": "2016-05-12T13:41:21Z",
    "body": "A note is preferred since we should only have one normative IDL statement for each thing. I'm not sure if IDL makes it a formal error, but it probably should for such duplication.\n\nMixin would replace the `[NoInterfaceObject]` construct to make it a little bit more obvious what is going on.\n",
